<td>Kimi K2.6</td>
<td>1T (Active 32B)</td>
<td>Modified MIT</td>
<td>Agent-specialized. Local use requires quantized GGUF</td>
</tr>
<tr data-line="65" class="code-line">
<td>Devstral 2</td>
<td>123B / Small 24B</td>
<td>Modified MIT (Small is Apache 2.0)</td>
